{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_x_033shr_2_1_2_033_22_t01",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:1fa403e0244a1545f2048bb6da15b9027a1e4e9671a26b367d41e2714fa68b73",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_x_033shr_2_1_2_033_22_t01:1_2_033_22_t01:cmd-000007:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:67a6ae1d5e15712541839c64c0dc84cc48983f5ac6c96f0ec1b6118e429a1ae0",
      "text": "喂，制作人？\n是我啦是我，志狼！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_033shr_2_1_2_033_22_t01:1_2_033_22_t01:cmd-000009:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a038a8791dce8a4484c26263b4159dedf70f802e2ccb1723904e816e2237cfff",
      "text": "今天的派对谢啦！\n话说回来，你既然知道就早点告诉我嘛～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_033shr_2_1_2_033_22_t01:1_2_033_22_t01:cmd-000011:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a3262b44a5239a8339e871e740ea14d66ace8ba2f6a541dc972f79ae39efd6fb",
      "text": "不过，那样就不算惊喜了啊……\n但是！我还是想更早知道嘛！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_033shr_2_1_2_033_22_t01:1_2_033_22_t01:cmd-000013:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:22607e42a156934636661f18d689576a9d97d7c685288afec5b4b57a9f69f7cf",
      "text": "虽然我早就猜到绝对会办生日会了。\n但大家瞒得也未免太好了吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_033shr_2_1_2_033_22_t01:1_2_033_22_t01:cmd-000015:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c8b3e9424b282aa7ee081c203e5e6dc205bfab5fc585b99d1b5a6a015691d2c8",
      "text": "瞒着你真是不好意思",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_033shr_2_1_2_033_22_t01:1_2_033_22_t01:cmd-000018:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:097cde2855fcf26a1ceef8106092e05423c032358715d2b4163e9f9b56674f6f",
      "text": "嘛，不过我在花音和直央过生日的时候，\n光是想象他们高兴的样子，心里也很兴奋来着。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_033shr_2_1_2_033_22_t01:1_2_033_22_t01:cmd-000020:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ad3268c06fbe5e1ee7253c3e765c047162774d3973e52818f73e013def8e497f",
      "text": "大家也是一样的心情对吧？\n那我也就没辙啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_033shr_2_1_2_033_22_t01:1_2_033_22_t01:cmd-000022:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cd52374233b3574eb1353b1e1acc19eaae5a4fee8e37ccd489df8036dd5193b0",
      "text": "他们两个当时\n也都很兴奋呢",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_033shr_2_1_2_033_22_t01:1_2_033_22_t01:cmd-000023:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6ad4b4fa7cfb406a58659efc268cdb70927a01fb6573268f8841212241daffce",
      "text": "很有大人的风范呢",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_033shr_2_1_2_033_22_t01:1_2_033_22_t01:cmd-000026:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:893619a57ff34955e254bd1710eb2e9b0439e716521723d853364ca351356686",
      "text": "被你这么夸还怪不好意思的！\n哈哈，看来那帮家伙的作战大获成功了啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_033shr_2_1_2_033_22_t01:1_2_033_22_t01:cmd-000030:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f2bdcab19103a4f596ff5570377da43f3bbe1f8143d3f7cb75eb5fe26d5c0457",
      "text": "哼哼，那是当然。\n这就是大人的应对方式啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_033shr_2_1_2_033_22_t01:1_2_033_22_t01:cmd-000034:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f93ecf9ded5571107f7334bbf82dc35680128a658874657bf6c0f3a50e162775",
      "text": "喂，●●●●プロデューサー。\n我今后还会成为更加更加了不起的大人物的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_033shr_2_1_2_033_22_t01:1_2_033_22_t01:cmd-000036:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d1b94caa6d958f38dbc6619a5dcd18af6c9453d081f12e4b6fdbad1d48f353e0",
      "text": "所以，你可要好好看着我的超级成长哦！\n那就晚安啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
